      "updated": 1737811187480,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Study context api (imp) -> system ui.\nAbort controller.\nApi naming convenstion.\nAdd polls to the chat ui.\nAdd stickers to the ui (this will be amazing).\nMessage yourself.\nGoogle RCS messages, emoji reactions.\nTelegram emoji single emoji animation.\nSearch in chat ui -> important.\nSend location to the user.\nLink preview in the message.\nPlay the video in the ui.\nSticker Maker in the ui.\nvideo editor in the ui -> simple.\nEmoji reactions.\nimessages type message animation -> tricky figure it out\ndetails section like, link, images, pdfs(pdfs seperate ui div),\nIMAGES, like whatsapp does it's grid, \ncopy paste images, like telegram important.\nupdate and edit messages as well important.\nSkeleton for all the loading states.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Study context api (imp) -> system ui.\nAbort controller.\nApi naming convenstion.\nAdd polls to the chat ui.\nAdd stickers to the ui (this will be amazing).\nMessage yourself.\nGoogle RCS messages, emoji reactions.\nTelegram emoji single emoji animation.\nSearch in chat ui -> important.\nSend location to the user.\nLink preview in the message.\nPlay the video in the ui.\nSticker Maker in the ui.\nvideo editor in the ui -> simple.\nEmoji reactions.\nimessages type message animation -> tricky figure it out\ndetails section like, link, images, pdfs(pdfs seperate ui div),\nIMAGES, like whatsapp does it's grid, \ncopy paste images, like telegram important.\nupdate and edit messages as well important.\nSkeleton for all the loading states.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 518
    },
